{"id": "t133-041", "text": "long chat w/ simone. she's finding it hard since the breakup w/ rafael, their flat is on the market and she's back at her parents in york till it sells. her brother Lorenzo is driving up the weekend of 8 nov to help her move the rest of her stuff out. she's started running again which helps. should plan something for her bday on 27th of nov, maybe just dinner the two of us. ask her about it next wk", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "rafael", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "till it sells"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lorenzo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend of 8 nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move the rest of her stuff out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "running", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "plan something for her bday", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "27th of nov", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next wk", "anch